@startuml
title Editor Input To Paint Flow

skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant "GooxEditorCanvas" as UI
participant "GooxEditorController" as Controller
participant "RustEditorCoreClient" as Client
participant "GooxBridgeClient\n+ FRB" as Bridge
participant "Rust EditorBuffer" as Core
participant "State Rebuild" as State
participant "TextField + Gutter" as Painter

User -> UI : key press / pointer action
UI -> Controller : normalized edit command
Controller -> Client : forward action
Client -> Bridge : applyTransaction / viewport requests
Bridge -> Core : Insert/Delete transaction
Core -> Core : apply rope mutation\npush undo entry\nincrement revision
Core -> Bridge : emit Vec<Patch>
Bridge -> Client : patch batch + revision
Client -> State : rebuild EditorViewState
State -> Painter : update visible model
Painter -> User : next frame

note over Core
Never ship full text
for the steady-state path.
end note

@enduml
